  "verseCount": 10,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "75",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 75"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "75",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, Al-taschith, A Psalm",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Song of Asaph.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unto thee, O God, do we give thanks,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "unto thee",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do we give thanks: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy name is near thy wondrous works declare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I shall receive the congregation I will judge uprightly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The earth and all the inhabitants thereof are dissolved: I bear up the pillars of it. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I said unto the fools, Deal not foolishly: and to the wicked, Lift not up the horn:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lift not up your horn on high: speak",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a stiff neck.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For promotion",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "cometh",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neither from the east, nor from the west, nor from the south.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For in the hand of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a cup, and the wine is red; it is full of mixture; and he poureth out of the same: but the dregs thereof, all the wicked of the earth shall wring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "out,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "drink",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will declare for ever; I will sing praises to the God of Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 75:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.75.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.75.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the horns of the righteous shall be exalted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.75.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.75.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.76",
    "number": "76",
